{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"\"Ah yes, *the payment*, Oaths are all well and good, but the promise of material gain is a *powerful motivator*, I will offer you the same thing I offered Wintergreen, a workshop stocked with the finest tools and materials, payment in the form of Essence and coin, and, *a title...*\" Malathor explains as he finishes his Apple, slipping the core into his sleeve.","created_at":"2021-07-25T22:58:12.589000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868990551700164659","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Jigsaw returns the glasses to their face as they look around their cluttered workshop. It's been slow going since the dirty coats took their things... \"Fine. I will accept your deal and work on your machine.\" They take a bite of the apple they'd accepted earlier with a grin.","created_at":"2021-07-25T23:02:38.874000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868991668580397067","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
