{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"*Malathor reaches out*, and traces a symbol with his clawlike fingertip just between Jigsaw's antennae, and then speaks in a gravely voice. \"*Rise Plăsmuitor Jigsaw, and wear your title with pride... We shall change history... *together.*\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T23:10:19.053000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868993598711005204","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
