{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863686287244656660","content":"Malathor grins with an equally fang-toothed smile. \"I shall meet with you and Ciocănaş Wintergreen later, and bring you to the *Abditum Sanctorum...* until then, perhaps speak with Cămăraș Bo to learn what to expect from our partnership. *Enjoy your evening*.\" Malathor says with a small bow, and then, *he is gone...*\n\n\nYou see him limping down #the-dock","created_at":"2021-07-25T23:21:57.499000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868996528205881445","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
